@startuml
!include style.puml

title Global appointment-conflict check

start

:Receive candidate appointment;

if () then ([new appointment])
    :No appointment is excluded;
else ([rescheduled appointment])
    :Remember original client and appointment
    as the exclusion;
endif

:Read the complete PawPals client list;

:Compare the candidate with every active appointment
of every client, ignoring the current UI filter
and completed-session history;

if () then ([conflict found])
    :Return Conflicted Client and Appointment;
else ([no conflict])
    :Return No Conflict;
endif

note right
Adjacent bookings are allowed according to
Appointment#overlaps(...).
end note

stop
@enduml
